SCOPE AND THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

The grant above covers the original work in this repository:

  - the analysis code in `analysis/`
  - the written material in `README.md` and `REPORT.md`
  - the run artifacts under `runs/` that were generated here: the directories
    dated 20260830 and 20260901, covering local Qwen3.5-35B-A3B, gpt-oss-20b,
    and gpt-oss-safeguard-20b

It does NOT cover the following, over which no rights are asserted:

  - The task, prompts and judge design, which come from adsingh-64/value-leakage
    (https://github.com/adsingh-64/value-leakage). Judge prompts are reproduced
    byte-for-byte, typos included.

  - The rollouts for the 10 shipped models under `runs/` dated 20260815. These
    originate from that same repository and are redistributed here only so that
    the re-analysis reported in REPORT.md can be independently verified.

  - The underlying study, TruthfulAI-research/value_leakage (arXiv:2607.14345),
    from which that reproduction derives.

Neither upstream repository states a license. The material above is redistributed
in good faith for verification of the analysis reported here, with attribution in
README.md and REPORT.md. If either set of authors would prefer it removed, please
open an issue and it will be.